      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Nariwa's assessed gross yield: 12,746.20731 koku (12,746 koku, 2 to, 7 gō, 3 shaku, 1 sai; the shō place is skipped, so it is zero). The interlinear note gives the domain's land-tax rate averaged over five years as 3-tsu 5-rin 4-mō 4-futsu and a fraction, that is roughly 30.5 percent of the assessed yield."
      },
      {
